  <li><strong>Camera-ready deadline</strong>: Friday, June 20, 2025</li>
  <li><strong>Start of Conference</strong>: Tuesday, June 24, 2025</li>
  <li><strong>End of Conference</strong>: Wednesday, June 25, 2025</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="publication-and-presentation">Publication and Presentation</h2>

<p>Accepted papers will be published in the symposium proceedings. At least one author must register and present the work virtually via a live or pre-recorded session.</p>

